{"ticker":{"symbol":"029460.KS","name":"케이씨","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":41500.0,"change_pct":0.03105590062111796,"market_cap":446429724672.0,"pe":5.51202,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.01036144578313253,"week52_low":23600.0,"week52_high":47900.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductor Equipment & Materials","country":"South Korea","city":"Anseong-si","employees":234,"website":"https://www.kctech.com","business_summary":"KC Co., Ltd. manufactures and distributes semiconductor systems, display systems, and electronic materials in South Korea and internationally. The company offers semiconductor equipment, including chemical mechanical polishing equipment, and wet cleaning systems. It also offers display equipment, such as wet station systems, atmospheric pressure plasma cleaners, CO2 cleaners, and coater and track systems that are used in LCD, LTPS, OLED, and flexible display panels; and slurries and additives. In addition, the company provides nano dispersion materials used in LCD and OLED films; and other solvent dispersion materials. KC Co., Ltd. was founded in 1987 and is headquartered in Anseong-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"KC(주)는 한국 및 해외에서 반도체 시스템, 디스플레이 시스템, 전자재료를 제조 및 유통하는 회사입니다. 이 회사는 화학 기계 연마 장비, 습식 세정 시스템을 포함한 반도체 장비를 제공합니다. 또한 LCD, LTPS, OLED 및 플렉서블 디스플레이 패널에 사용되는 습식 스테이션 시스템, 대기압 플라즈마 클리너, CO2 클리너, 코터 및 트랙 시스템과 같은 디스플레이 장비도 제공합니다. 및 슬러리 및 첨가제. 또한, LCD 및 OLED 필름에 사용되는 나노 분산 소재를 제공합니다. 및 기타 용매 분산 재료. KC Co., Ltd.는 1987년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 안성시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":936800000000.0,"rev_lo":936800000000.0,"rev_hi":936800000000.0,"rev_g":null,"n":1,"eps":6387.0,"eps_lo":6387.0,"eps_hi":6387.0,"eps_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":1068700000000.0,"rev_lo":1068700000000.0,"rev_hi":1068700000000.0,"rev_g":0.1408,"n":1,"eps":7529.0,"eps_lo":7529.0,"eps_hi":7529.0,"eps_g":0.17879999}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"반도체 장비·소재","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":857973655250